# A query that starts with a name, a string or a call followed by `|`: DS0150 with a machine-applicable fix.
mode: syntax
---- query
orders | take 5;
'data/orders.csv' | where amount > 100;
read_csv('x.txt', delimiter = ';') | take 5;
my_reader('x') | count
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..125
  PIPELINE@0..15
    NAME_REF@0..6
      IDENT@0..6 "orders"
    WHITESPACE@6..7 " "
    PIPE@7..8 "|"
    WHITESPACE@8..9 " "
    TAKE_OP@9..15
      IDENT@9..13 "take"
      WHITESPACE@13..14 " "
      LITERAL@14..15
        LONG@14..15 "5"
  SEMICOLON@15..16 ";"
  WHITESPACE@16..17 "\n"
  PIPELINE@17..55
    LITERAL@17..34
      STRING@17..34 "'data/orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@34..35 " "
    PIPE@35..36 "|"
    WHITESPACE@36..37 " "
    WHERE_OP@37..55
      IDENT@37..42 "where"
      WHITESPACE@42..43 " "
      BIN_EXPR@43..55
        NAME_REF@43..49
          IDENT@43..49 "amount"
        WHITESPACE@49..50 " "
        GT@50..51 ">"
        WHITESPACE@51..52 " "
        LITERAL@52..55
          LONG@52..55 "100"
  SEMICOLON@55..56 ";"
  WHITESPACE@56..57 "\n"
  PIPELINE@57..100
    CALL_EXPR@57..91
      NAME_REF@57..65
        IDENT@57..65 "read_csv"
      ARG_LIST@65..91
        L_PAREN@65..66 "("
        LITERAL@66..73
          STRING@66..73 "'x.txt'"
        COMMA@73..74 ","
        WHITESPACE@74..75 " "
        NAMED_EXPR@75..90
          NAME@75..84
            IDENT@75..84 "delimiter"
          WHITESPACE@84..85 " "
          EQ@85..86 "="
          WHITESPACE@86..87 " "
          LITERAL@87..90
            STRING@87..90 "';'"
        R_PAREN@90..91 ")"
    WHITESPACE@91..92 " "
    PIPE@92..93 "|"
    WHITESPACE@93..94 " "
    TAKE_OP@94..100
      IDENT@94..98 "take"
      WHITESPACE@98..99 " "
      LITERAL@99..100
        LONG@99..100 "5"
  SEMICOLON@100..101 ";"
  WHITESPACE@101..102 "\n"
  PIPELINE@102..124
    CALL_EXPR@102..116
      NAME_REF@102..111
        IDENT@102..111 "my_reader"
      ARG_LIST@111..116
        L_PAREN@111..112 "("
        LITERAL@112..115
          STRING@112..115 "'x'"
        R_PAREN@115..116 ")"
    WHITESPACE@116..117 " "
    PIPE@117..118 "|"
    WHITESPACE@118..119 " "
    COUNT_OP@119..124
      IDENT@119..124 "count"
  WHITESPACE@124..125 "\n"

error[DS0150]: a query starts with `from`
  --> query:1:1
  |
1 | orders | take 5;
  | ^^^^^^ this table needs `from` before it
  |
  = help: insert `from`: `from orders`

error[DS0150]: a query starts with `from`
  --> query:2:1
  |
2 | 'data/orders.csv' | where amount > 100;
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this table needs `from` before it
  |
  = help: insert `from`: `from 'data/orders.csv'`

error[DS0150]: a query starts with `from`
  --> query:3:1
  |
3 | read_csv('x.txt', delimiter = ';') | take 5;
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this table needs `from` before it
  |
  = help: insert `from`: `from read_csv('x.txt', delimiter = ';')`

error[DS0150]: a query starts with `from`
  --> query:4:1
  |
4 | my_reader('x') | count
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this table needs `from` before it
  |
  = help: insert `from`: `from my_reader('x')`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    from orders | take 5;
    from 'data/orders.csv' | where amount > 100;
    from read_csv('x.txt', delimiter = ';') | take 5;
    from my_reader('x') | count
which parses without errors
